WEBVTT

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.070
Is it a fire?

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.610
Is it a drill?

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.280
Light that fire...

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.280
Looks like a gas explosion.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:59.450
Bring the camera, quick!

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:21.930
350 ml. of this delicious refreshment will...yawn.

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.270
This isn't going to make me feel better.

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.440
Help me! Please help me.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.490
You've gotta help me escape!

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.910
What's happened to you?

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:42.240
Well, uh... a monster's coming after me!

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.830
Hurry! Get me out of here! Please!

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:55.260
(x+y)³ = x³ + 2xy + y³

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.850
Hey, you mind keeping quiet for a bit?

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:05.640
I've got my admissions exam to take tomorrow.

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:10.690
Nevermind that! This is about my life here!

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.270
Hey, I've got my own problems too, you know.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:18.070
Playing hide-and-seek years ago, I remember that...

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.740
I never got caught when I hid here.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.090
Why am I running away with you?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:14.170
There's no way out from this now, Geega.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:39.990
Birdy, it looks like you killed a human.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.410
We will soon meet again.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.650
What's this?

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.270
Is this a dream?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.740
I couldn't avoid it when Geega took him and...

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.320
I don't want to hear excuses.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:30.450
Officer Birdy Cephon Altirra, you've made a grievous error.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.620
Your methods were unsound.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.580
What...?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.040
Are you ready?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:40.000
No way! I don't want to be stuck with this puny little human.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.840
Puny little...? Is she talking about me ?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.800
Leave me alone.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:53.770
I feel great. Maybe I'll never wake up, and then...

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.020
Hurry! The window will soon close.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.860
I'm really not into this.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.180
My bag!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.310
I wonder what he would be going to school for on a Sunday.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.730
He's taking the admissions exam for senior high school.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.230
Why's he wearing his uniform?

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.400
Please, today is not a good day to start picking on him.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.320
He already has it tough as it is.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.740
Well, I never wore a uniform for my exams.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.080
I gotta wash my face!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.870
You'd better have breakfast or you'll starve during the exam.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.670
Tsutomu, tell me, why are you wearing that...

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.210
Enough about the uniform, dear.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.670
Just wondering.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.680
I'm forgetting everything that I studied!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.310
Calm down Tsutomu. Have you got your exam card?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.150
It dropped out.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:21.940
It sure did.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.570
Well, I'm off.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.160
Hazumi, how could you say that? And Father too.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.410
What a family I've got.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.000
I'm off!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.680
Is this some kind of dream or what?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:05.860
Well, I'm not going to think about this now.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.160
That's the kid from yesterday.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.830
I thought he was supposed to be dead.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:19.620
Strange...

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.630
We had better clear this up before Ms. Revi returns.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.380
You just make things sound so simple, Gomez.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:34.090
''Admissions Exams''

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.520
Well this is it.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.690
Hey, Tsutomu!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.560
Good morning.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.310
Hi Natsumi.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.020
So, I see that you're taking the exam too.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:50.360
What a relief, I thought I was the only one from our class taking it.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.030
Well, I thought I'd check it out.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.530
Let's do our best! Bye!

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.100
You really look nervous.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:24.230
I've got just the thing for a time like this.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.230
Hey, check it out, will ya!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.450
Those hips are too much, don't you think?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.450
Take it if you want.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.030
Later.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.380
Oh, no. I can't concentrate anymore.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.930
I can't make any sense of this.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.170
Hey, what's the matter?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.890
Sorry. It's nothing.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.890
Stressed out, are we?

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.520
What was that all about?

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.820
Phew! I'm glad it's over.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.080
When you think about it...

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.410
...there's no reason I couldn't have solved all those problems, ya know.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.830
All that studying and stress must have played with my mind.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.790
I bet that must be it.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:09.210
''Kakuta Building''

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:13.960
I guess I'm finally free from exam hell.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.840
I'm just going to take it easy for a while.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.680
''Safety First''

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.570
lsn't this dangerous?

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.610
I'll die if I fall from here.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.200
Son, you should already BE dead!

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:46.540
I want to know how that police officer brought you back...

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.420
But first, tell me where that insolent little wench is.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.710
What are you talking about?

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:01.050
Let's switch now. He's not human.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:09.640
You!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.900
I'm glad you came to see me, Geega.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.900
That's not my voice.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.590
Geega, it's your turn to give me some answers.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.630
Where is Christella Revi?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.680
You think I'm going to tell?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.600
You'll feel less guilty if you do.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.310
I guess there's no point.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.810
How dare you.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:56.320
Looks like I'll just have to send you on your way.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.160
Off he goes...

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.670
Tsutomu.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:23.970
What happened to you Tsutomu?

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.260
''Safety First''

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.560
Tsutomu?!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:49.490
''Takashou''

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.830
''Hikawa Chemistry Inc.''

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.550
Whats with the Bankers?

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.680
A lot of work needs to be done...

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.140
...to get funding for the plant expansion.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.520
You sure do move fast, Hikawa.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.190
Although I think you're missing some information.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.950
Ms. Revi will be returning this evening.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.660
This evening?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.240
Looks like you really messed up.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.450
Can't help you this time.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.970
How are you going to be able to show your face to her?

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.640
Doctor, I'm far more concerned about the fact...

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.100
that you are drinking too much of that.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.990
Did you get in touch with Bachilus?

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.890
His uniform's all torn to shreds.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.890
I wonder if he actually took the exam.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.190
I bet you he didn't.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.850
He has a rebellious streak in him...

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.520
...just like any boy in puberty.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.320
Say something about a uniform?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.490
Nevermind, dear.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.800
I see. Okay, I get it.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.010
It's just a dream. A big long dream.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.380
That's all.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:12.760
Time for bed...

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.050
Hey!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.720
Get with it, boy!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.850
Why do I have to put up with this wimp?

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.850
What's going on?!

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.360
Who are you? What do you want with me?!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.650
Show yourself!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.360
Listen to him, he's shouting now...

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:33.200
Well, aren't you slow? I'm inside of you.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.040
The name's Birdy. Officer Birdy Cephon Altirra.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.380
What an idiot.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.130
What are you doing?!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.090
You think I want to be stuck here?

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:53.260
Who asked you? Just get out of me!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.350
I would if I could.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.470
We have to get going.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.350
Hurry up! Run properly!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.860
Stop it! How dare you use my body like that!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.110
Enter there.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:25.290
Why are you bringing me to a place like this?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.880
I want you to clearly understand what's going on here.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.840
See that car there? Open the door and get in.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:35.760
You're kidding.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.510
Do as I say!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.360
Are you serious?

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.650
Get in!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.670
Wha...?!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:30.570
A monster!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.320
Tsutomu Senkawa.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.740
I'm sorry to scare you so.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:41.450
I am Inspector Megius of the Space Federation.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:46.160
This hologram is being transmitted from far in space.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.380
It is so that I can explain everything to you.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:53.960
Now you must listen carefully to me young, Tsutomu Senkawa.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:58.590
Every cell in your entire body is already dead.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:02.260
This was the result of an accident.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:07.310
I know that this is not something you can forgive so easily.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.820
So in order to maintain your life...

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.360
...we have merged the body of another onto yours.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.780
She is called Birdy.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.490
She's the one that caused the accident.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.250
She is an lkus-class Altirrian humanoid...

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:30.460
...and possesses the same cellular form as humans.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:36.590
Her cell mass was reconfigured to replace your body.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:41.090
We have not changed your physiological functions.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:45.310
We've made sure that this does not affect your daily living.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.100
But...

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.860
This may all seem unbelievable to you..

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.440
but it is very real.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:02.030
You mean, you mean my body's been invaded by an alien?

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:04.120
But how...?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.500
Not again?!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.040
What...?!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:14.460
The memory of Birdy herself is etched within you.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.010
Violin!

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:26.350
Where are you?

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.310
Violin!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.700
Are you impressed?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:53.000
With this little gift from Christella Revi.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.040
Violin.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:01.340
Please don't die! Violin!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.800
Tsutomu Senkawa...

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:11.980
We can only hope that you will cooperate with us.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:16.230
Take care of Birdy for me.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.990
Take care of her?

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.410
Birdy...

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.370
I wonder, who's Violin?

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.300
What's this thing?

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:45.390
It's a modulator. To keep your clothes from getting ripped up.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.180
Hey, wait a minute!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.360
I will capture Revi on this planet.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.360
Please, I'm going to need you to help me.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:27.720
It's good to see you again, Ms. Revi.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:31.720
How was your flight?

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:39.360
Where's Gomez?

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.650
He's trying to sort a few things out.

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:44.030
And how about you?

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:48.030
Not to worry. In about 2 months we'll probably...

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.950
Probably doesn't cut it. You know that.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:56.500
Yes.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:02.750
''Senkawa''

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:37.910
Tsutomu, just what did happen to you today, anyway?

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:43.460
Yeah...

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:45.550
I heard your uniform got all torn up-

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:48.170
Seconds, dear? How about more?

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.470
Dear?

00:22:52.760 --> 00:22:55.310
So, why was your uniform all...

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:56.600
Dear...!

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:05.440
Hey Tsutomu, have you made an imaginary friend or something lately?

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:06.820
Hazumi!

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:11.030
You know, I don't think it's right to be tip-toeing...

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.450
around the patient the way you are.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.910
Nobody's a ''patient!''

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.870
Thanks for dinner. I'm taking a bath now.

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:23.880
Hey, Tsutomu?

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:26.420
That's enough! What's the matter with you?

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:46.360
Come here. Come over here.

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:48.070
''No Trespassing''

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:49.240
Here.

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:01.330
You seem to have it pretty tough at home.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.670
Well, I'm kinda used to it.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:08.960
What is it?

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:13.970
Nothing, really. It just, you know, seems kind of weird when I remember...

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:17.350
that there's a girl trapped in my body.

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:20.060
Well, I feel the same way.

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.440
I guess so.

00:24:23.310 --> 00:24:25.440
I'm going to take a bath too.

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:28.020
Tsutomu's still in there.

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:31.570
Sometimes naked communication between father and son is the way to go.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:32.700
Communication?

00:25:00.720 --> 00:25:02.770
What is it? What's going on?

00:25:03.730 --> 00:25:07.940
This is the smell of one who has killed many.

00:25:15.450 --> 00:25:16.240
Excuse me.

00:25:17.240 --> 00:25:18.240
Not at all.

00:25:24.540 --> 00:25:25.460
Hey!

00:25:26.370 --> 00:25:28.460
Do we have a guest in the house?

00:25:29.710 --> 00:25:31.210
Hey!

00:25:33.010 --> 00:25:35.930
My father saw. What are you going to do about it?

00:25:36.840 --> 00:25:37.470
Quiet!

00:25:39.100 --> 00:25:40.510
It's coming closer.

00:25:40.600 --> 00:25:41.470
Who is?

00:25:44.390 --> 00:25:46.230
Hey! At least put on some clothes!

00:26:09.130 --> 00:26:10.710
What the heck is that?

00:26:11.210 --> 00:26:16.720
Altirrian Officer. To think that you defeated Geega...

00:26:17.340 --> 00:26:20.720
Bachilus, it looks like you were hired on by Revi.

00:26:21.300 --> 00:26:22.720
I suppose.

00:26:35.030 --> 00:26:36.860
Damn.

00:26:38.820 --> 00:26:41.660
I don't like it. Power techniques don't work on him.

00:26:41.740 --> 00:26:43.370
So, what are you going to do?

00:26:44.740 --> 00:26:46.500
Don't you have some other technique?

00:26:47.120 --> 00:26:50.500
I have just the technique for this, but...

00:26:54.000 --> 00:26:55.420
What's this technique?

00:26:58.090 --> 00:26:59.510
A chemical weapon.

00:26:59.510 --> 00:27:04.640
Combining hydrophilic and hydrophobic colloids in a molecule would work...

00:27:04.930 --> 00:27:07.230
Like a surface-active agent.

00:27:07.310 --> 00:27:09.770
That's right. But I didn't bring it with me.

00:27:11.900 --> 00:27:14.690
Then let's get out of here. Let's go home.

00:27:14.730 --> 00:27:17.150
There's no use. He'll follow us.

00:27:17.190 --> 00:27:18.400
Hurry!

00:27:22.410 --> 00:27:24.450
All right, you two...

00:27:25.120 --> 00:27:28.750
I'm telling you, the girl in the bath is not Tsutomu.

00:27:28.830 --> 00:27:30.460
So, open the door.

00:27:31.920 --> 00:27:37.170
Now I will demonstrate whether I'm telling the truth or not.

00:27:37.550 --> 00:27:40.170
Excuse me, but I just have to open the door.

00:27:50.640 --> 00:27:52.100
Looks like Tsutomu.

00:27:52.190 --> 00:27:53.100
Right.

00:27:53.560 --> 00:27:54.650
Huh?

00:27:58.650 --> 00:27:59.610
''MOMO Detergent''

00:28:11.790 --> 00:28:15.880
What do you plan on doing with the bat?

00:28:40.820 --> 00:28:43.280
Hey. He's behind you.

00:28:50.330 --> 00:28:52.410
Time to trade places.

00:28:53.580 --> 00:28:54.830
Hurry up.

00:28:56.290 --> 00:28:59.840
We can't switch until you open your consciousness.

00:29:30.700 --> 00:29:33.290
Why do you have a weapon like that?

00:29:34.830 --> 00:29:37.830
Hey, it's to fight dirt and filth around the house.

00:29:40.460 --> 00:29:41.670
Excuse me.

00:29:42.510 --> 00:29:45.720
Why are you making a mess like this?

00:29:46.220 --> 00:29:48.220
I'm sorry. I'll clean it up right away, okay?

00:29:52.680 --> 00:29:55.980
Why didn't you switch with me?

00:29:57.310 --> 00:29:58.150
Answer me.

00:29:58.810 --> 00:30:00.310
Hey, leave me alone.

00:30:01.020 --> 00:30:05.860
You shouldn't think you can take me over whenever you feel like it, okay?

00:30:06.570 --> 00:30:07.490
Sorry.

00:30:08.200 --> 00:30:09.160
But...

00:30:22.800 --> 00:30:24.460
What is it this time?

00:30:24.590 --> 00:30:27.550
He's an Arkazoid. A robot, basically.

00:30:28.010 --> 00:30:29.720
All right. Time to switch.

00:30:29.760 --> 00:30:32.970
Why are there robots and monsters roaming the streets?!

00:30:38.890 --> 00:30:40.020
This is...

00:30:41.860 --> 00:30:43.020
...not reality!

00:30:45.650 --> 00:30:48.490
You're not real! You're just an illusion!

00:30:49.820 --> 00:30:51.870
You're not real!

00:30:57.410 --> 00:30:59.210
Come on, give it up.

00:31:06.090 --> 00:31:07.590
I said give it up!

00:31:08.050 --> 00:31:10.840
No way! I'm not going to take it!

00:31:10.930 --> 00:31:14.930
For 3 years now, I've given up my holidays and vacations...

00:31:15.010 --> 00:31:17.930
...so I could study as hard as I could every single day.

00:31:17.980 --> 00:31:21.730
And I've just finally taken my exams.

00:31:22.060 --> 00:31:26.530
You just don't know a thing about what it's like! I just...

00:31:28.740 --> 00:31:31.280
I just want to be a regular kid!

00:31:35.790 --> 00:31:37.080
Leave me alone!

00:31:57.010 --> 00:31:59.310
I'll leave this to you after all, Birdy!

00:31:59.390 --> 00:32:00.560
Okay!

00:32:11.490 --> 00:32:14.120
What do metal heads like you want with me?

00:32:19.870 --> 00:32:24.000
My, my. You looked much cuter with the hat on.

00:32:43.390 --> 00:32:44.850
So, then...

00:32:47.440 --> 00:32:48.730
Here we go!

00:33:03.160 --> 00:33:04.290
There!

00:33:15.380 --> 00:33:18.640
You sure are strong. You dealt with them just like that.

00:33:20.930 --> 00:33:22.890
Wrong. It's not over yet.

00:33:54.090 --> 00:33:55.220
Didn't THINK that'd work.

00:34:12.480 --> 00:34:15.190
Don't think you can beat me, little girl.

00:34:24.080 --> 00:34:24.910
Birdy!

00:34:32.460 --> 00:34:37.010
Birdy! What's happened? Come on. Get up!

00:34:37.090 --> 00:34:39.590
At this rate, I'm going to die too!

00:34:39.680 --> 00:34:41.640
Birdy!

00:34:47.100 --> 00:34:49.650
So much for the Federation Officer.

00:34:56.940 --> 00:35:00.610
You've sure got a lot of spirit. This could be fun.

00:35:05.080 --> 00:35:07.120
Are you all right, Birdy?

00:35:10.960 --> 00:35:12.460
Go left there.

00:35:16.460 --> 00:35:17.170
It's a dead end.

00:35:23.180 --> 00:35:25.010
Oh, now I see...

00:35:33.360 --> 00:35:35.520
Birdy, pick up the gas can.

00:36:17.400 --> 00:36:19.070
What's wrong, Birdy?

00:36:19.110 --> 00:36:22.150
Sorry. I'm just a little tired.

00:36:22.240 --> 00:36:25.280
I guess. You sure went through a lot.

00:36:25.370 --> 00:36:29.240
You did well too. I'm a little impressed.

00:36:29.750 --> 00:36:32.710
Just a little, huh?

00:36:36.500 --> 00:36:37.710
Look. Snow.

00:36:43.470 --> 00:36:47.550
So tell me, what happens from now on?

00:36:48.260 --> 00:36:51.770
Did you fall asleep or what, Birdy?

00:36:53.480 --> 00:36:56.110
But really, what'll I do?

00:37:10.790 --> 00:37:14.080
Suddenly we meet by accident

00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:21.460
My heart is susceptible to getting caught

00:37:23.840 --> 00:37:29.260
Whether it be by road or jet, I will dash out

00:37:29.260 --> 00:37:34.230
Hey go go, Okay go go girl

00:37:35.850 --> 00:37:39.480
I absolutely will not let go

00:37:42.360 --> 00:37:46.530
I will take you by force

00:37:49.200 --> 00:37:54.950
running to the amusement park

00:37:55.210 --> 00:37:58.210
Follow me

00:38:00.540 --> 00:38:04.590
That's right, <i>Future Shock</i>, to you...

00:38:04.590 --> 00:38:07.800
<i>Future Shock</i>, dashing around

00:38:07.800 --> 00:38:13.970
<i>Future Shock</i>, don't say that you don't understand me

00:38:13.970 --> 00:38:17.140
I want you to stay with me

00:38:17.270 --> 00:38:22.230
Let's find the same thrill

00:38:38.790 --> 00:38:40.960
That's <i>Future Shock</i>

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:44.380
My <i>Future Shock</i>

00:38:44.380 --> 00:38:47.420
Accept it, <i>Future Shock</i>

00:38:47.420 --> 00:38:52.140
I'm sorry if it shocks you,

00:38:52.390 --> 00:38:55.560
It's just that I love you

00:38:55.560 --> 00:38:57.870
So from now on

00:38:57.870 --> 00:39:00.050
Keep searching for

00:38:58.760 --> 00:39:00.120
<i>Future Shock</i>

00:39:00.120 --> 00:39:03.290
My, <i>Future Shock</i>

00:39:03.290 --> 00:39:06.390
Way to love, <i>Future Shock</i>

00:39:06.470 --> 00:39:10.980
I can't go back alone

00:39:10.980 --> 00:39:14.550
Keep holding on,

00:39:14.550 --> 00:39:19.830
Let's face and fly toward the future
